cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "fair-data-access"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A method and open-source implementation for expressing and enforcing access to
  sensitive FAIR Digital Objects, combining ODRL policies, nanopublication-based
  access grants, Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs) and authenticated encryption
  (AES-256-GCM with ECDH/HKDF key wrapping). Developed in the FAIR2Adapt project
  for controlled-access climate change adaptation data.
authors:
  - family-names: "Fouilloux"
    given-names: "Anne"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1784-2920"
    affiliation: "LifeWatch ERIC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/FAIR2Adapt/fair-data-access"
url: "https://fair2adapt.github.io/fair-data-access/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
